    {
      "id": "v_d6Ares",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5968,
      "src": "6*Rd_b1 >= F_f ="
    },
    {
      "id": "t33",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6016,
      "src": "J3.9 es explícito: la conexión de deslizamiento crítico debe cumplir ADEMÁS todos los estados límite de aplastamiento — por eso los dos bloques anteriores siguen valiendo"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_gob",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6064,
      "src": "u_des > u_per ="
    },
    {
      "id": "s34",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6128,
      "src": "━━ 5 · EL EMPALME DEL ALMA ━━",
      "pageBreak": true
    },
    {
      "id": "t35",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6176,
      "src": "Las dos planchas llevan el corte, con la excentricidad hasta la línea de pernos. Los 4 pernos van en corte doble → 2 planos."
    },
    {
      "id": "r080",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6224,
      "src": "M_e := V_u*e_w = tonf*m"
    },
    {
      "id": "r081",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6272,
      "src": "y_max := 3*s/2 = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r082",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6320,
      "src": "J_w := 2*((s/2)^2 + y_max^2) = cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r083",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6368,
      "src": "r_m := M_e*y_max/J_w = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r084",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6416,
      "src": "r_v := V_u/n_w = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r085",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6464,
      "src": "r_b := sqrt(r_m^2 + r_v^2) = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r086",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6512,
      "src": "Rd_bw := 2*Rd_b1 = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r087",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6560,
      "src": "u_exc := r_b/Rd_bw ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_exc",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6608,
      "src": "Rd_bw >= r_b ="
    },
    {
      "id": "t36",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6656,
      "src": "Deslizamiento del mismo grupo, con n_s = 2 (corte doble = dos planos de deslizamiento)"
    },
    {
      "id": "r088",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6704,
      "src": "Rs_w := 2*Rs_1 = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "r089",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6752,
      "src": "u_desw := r_b/Rs_w ="
    },
    {
      "id": "v_desw",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6800,
      "src": "Rs_w >= r_b ="
    },
    {
      "id": "t37",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6848,
      "src": "Las planchas en corte (J4.2) y en flexión (J4.5, con Z plástico)"
